\v 9 I'll bring¦337102 you out¦337102 from¦337104 the city, and¦337102 put you into¦337107 the¦337107 hands¦337107 of¦337107 foreigners¦337109, because I'll bring¦337110 judgement¦337112 against you \add people\add*.
