\v 12 Then¦337145 you'll know¦337145 that¦337146 I¦337148 am¦337149 Yahweh¦337149, the one whose instructions¦337151 you haven't \add ≈obeyed\add* and¦337145 whose regulations¦337151 you haven't \add ≈followed\add*. Instead, you people have¦337153 \add imitated\add* the¦337157 \add wicked\add* \add ≈customs\add* of¦337157 the¦337158 nations¦337158 that¦337159 surround¦337160 you.”
