\v 13 Then¦337163 as¦337164 I was¦337163 prophesying¦337164, Benayah's¦337168 son¦337166 Felatyah died¦337169. \add ≈So¦337163\add* I fell¦337170 \add ≈to my knees with my face¦337173 bowed low to the ground\add* and¦337163 cried¦337174 out¦337174 with a loud voice¦337175, “Oh no, my¦337180 master¦337180 Yahweh¦337180, will¦337183 you¦337183 completely¦337182 \add ≈eliminate the¦337186 Israeli¦337186 people\add*?”
