\v 17 So¦337248 \add explain\add* \add to them\add*, ‘My¦337253 master¦337253 Yahweh¦337253 says¦337252 this: ‘I'll gather¦337255 you from¦337257 the¦337259 people¦337259 groups, and¦337260 assemble¦337260 you from¦337262 the¦337264 lands¦337264 where you were¦337266 scattered¦337266, and¦337268 I'll give¦337268 you \add back\add* the \add ≈country¦337264\add* of¦337272 Yisrael¦337273.’
