\v 19 and¦337291 I'll give¦337291 them¦337292 one¦337294 heart, and¦337295 I'll put¦337297 a new¦337296 spirit¦337295 in¦337298 them. I'll take¦337299 the¦337300 \add ≈rock-hard¦337301\add* heart out of¦337300 \add ≈them\add* and¦337303 give¦337303 them¦337304 \add ≈a tender heart¦337305\add*,\x + \xo 11:19-20: \xt Eze 36:26-28.\x*
\v 20 so¦337308 that¦337308 they'll \add ≈follow my instructions¦337309 and obey my regulations¦337309\add*. Then¦337321 they'll be my people¦337320, and¦337321 I'll¦337322 be their god¦337324.
