\v 1 Then Yahweh¦337400 \add ≈gave me¦337401 this\add* message¦337398:
\v 2 “Son¦337404 of¦337404 humanity¦337406, you¦337411 live¦337412 among a rebellious \add ≈people group\add* who¦337413 have eyes¦337414 to see, yet they don't see, and¦337417 who have ears¦337419 to hear¦337421, but¦337417 don't listen¦337421, because¦337424 they're a rebellious¦337426 \add ≈people group\add*.\x + \xo 12:2: \xt Isa 6:9-10; Jer 5:21; Mrk 8:18.\x*
\p
\v 3 “Therefore, son¦337430 of¦337430 humanity¦337432, \add ≈pack up your stuff ready¦337433 to¦337434 go¦337437 into¦337437\add* exile, and¦337429 \add ≈each day¦337438 while they're watching\add*, start going¦337440 out \add somewhere\add*, because¦337449 \add ≈while they're watching\add*, I'll exile you¦337440 from¦337441 your place to another¦337445 place. Perhaps¦337447 they'll¦337448 begin to see¦337448, even though they're \add such\add* rebellious¦337451 \add ≈people¦337432\add*.
\v 4 \add ≈Each day¦337458 while they're watching,\add* bring¦337454 out¦337454 your¦337455 things for an exile¦337457, \add then\add* as they watch in the evening¦337462, go¦337461 out¦337461 in the way that \add ≈people do\add* when going¦337464 into exile¦337465.
\v 5 Dig¦337468 a hole through the \add city\add* wall¦337471 \add ≈where they'll see you¦337472 do it\add*, and¦337472 go out¦337472 through it¦337473.
\v 6 \add ≈While¦337494 they're watching\add*, lift¦337479 your things up¦337479 onto your shoulder¦337478, and¦337484 bring¦337481 them out¦337481 in¦337480 the darkness¦337480. Cover¦337483 your face¦337482, because¦337489 you mustn't see¦337485 \add &this¦337488\add* land¦337488, since I've¦337492 \add ≈made¦337492 you into\add* a sign¦337491 for¦337489 the¦337493 \add ≈Israeli¦337493 people\add*.”
\p
\v 7 So¦337496 I did¦337496 just¦337498 as¦337498 I was¦337499 instructed¦337499: I brought my things for an exile¦337503 out in the daytime¦337504, and¦337505 in¦337505 the evening¦337505 I dug¦337506 a hole through¦337504 the wall¦337509 by¦337510 hand¦337510. I brought my things out in¦337511 the dark¦337511, and lifted¦337516 them up¦337516 onto my shoulder¦337515 \add ≈as they¦337502 watched¦337502\add*.
