\v 22 “Son¦337745 of¦337745 humanity¦337747, what's¦337748 that saying¦337757 that you¦337752 have in Yisrael¦337756? It¦337760 goes, ‘The¦337750 days¦337759 \add ≈seem to¦337752 go on¦337753 and¦337760 on, yet no prophecy ever comes¦337760 true.\add*’
