\v 24 because¦337796 there'll no longer be¦337798 any¦337800 false visions¦337802 or \add ≈people-pleasing prophecies\add* within Yisrael¦337808.
\v 25 I speak¦337814, and I \add ≈put the words that¦337816 I speak¦337817 into action\add*, because¦337823 I am Yahweh¦337832. The¦337826 matter will¦337827 no longer be¦337819 delayed, because I'll speak this message¦337818 in¦337824 your \add ≈lifetimes¦337824\add*, \add you\add* rebellious¦337826 \add ≈people\add*, and¦337829 then I'll carry it¦337829 out!’ That's the¦337830 master¦337831 Yahweh's¦337813 declaration¦337830.”
