\v 26 Then Yahweh¦337838 \add ≈gave me¦337839\add* \add another\add* message¦337836:
\v 27 “Listen, son¦337842 of¦337842 humanity¦337844, the¦337846 \add ≈Israeli¦337846 people¦337844\add* have said¦337849, ‘The¦337850 vision¦337850 that¦337851 \add @the¦337853 prophet¦337853\add* sees¦337854 is¦337854 for many¦337856 years¦337855 from now, and¦337857 he¦337859 prophesies¦337860 about¦337842 far-off times¦337857,’
