\p
\v 1 Then Yahweh¦337888 \add ≈gave me¦337889\add* \add another\add* message¦337886:
\v 2 “Son¦337892 of¦337892 humanity¦337894, prophesy¦337895 against¦337896 the¦337898 prophets¦337898 who are prophesying in Yisrael¦337899, and¦337901 tell¦337901 those who are prophesying¦337902 out of¦337902 their¦337903 own¦337903 imaginations¦337903, ‘Listen¦337904 to¦337902 Yahweh's¦337907 message¦337905.
\v 3 My¦337911 master¦337911 Yahweh¦337911 says¦337910 this: ‘Foolish¦337912 prophets¦337916 who¦337918 follow their¦337921 own¦337921 spirit¦337921 and¦337922 haven't \add actually\add* seen¦337923 any \add vision\add* \add ≈won't¦337922 end well\add*.
\v 4 Yisrael¦337928, your¦337927 prophets¦337927 have¦337929 been¦337929 like¦337925 jackals¦337925 in¦337926 the wastelands.
\v 5 You¦337939 haven't gone¦337932 to the breaks in¦337933 the \add #walls¦337935\add* around the¦337938 Israeli¦337938 \add cities\add* and¦337934 repaired¦337934 them, in order to \add ≈be able to defend yourselves well during¦337941\add* the battle¦337941 on¦337933 Yahweh's¦337943 \add chosen\add* day¦337942.
\v 6 The¦337950 people have¦337945 false visions¦337945 and¦337947 make false¦337948 predictions. Yahweh¦337953 hasn't sent¦337955 those¦337949 who¦337949 say¦337949 that they're bringing Yahweh's¦337952 declaration¦337950, \add ≈but¦337947 nevertheless they've¦337956 made people hope that their messages¦337958 would come true\add*.
\v 7 Haven't¦337974 you had¦337964 false visions¦337961 and¦337968 made false predictions—all of¦337969 you who say that you're bringing Yahweh's¦337971 declaration¦337969 when I¦337972 myself haven't spoken¦337974?’
\p
\v 8 Therefore the¦337990 master¦337991 Yahweh¦337992 says¦337979 this, ‘Because¦337982 you¦337983 \add people\add* have \add ≈presented\add* false¦337986 visions¦337985 and¦337985 have told¦337983 lies¦337986, this is¦337989 the master Yahweh's¦337981 declaration¦337990 against¦337989 you:
\v 9 \add ≈I'll punish\add* the¦337998 prophets¦337998 who¦337999 have lying visions¦337999 and¦337994 who¦338001 make false¦338002 predictions. They won't¦338005 be¦338007 \add allowed\add* in the assembly of my¦337995 people¦338004, or enrolled in¦338008 the record of Yisrael's¦338017 \add ≈descendants\add*. They¦338019 mustn't go¦338019 to¦338014 the¦338016 land¦338016 of Yisrael¦338011—\add ≈that's¦337999 how\add* you \add people\add* will¦338019 know¦338020 that¦338021 I¦338022 am the master¦338023 Yahweh¦338023.
\p
\v 10 Also¦338027 because¦338027 they¦338028 led¦338028 my¦338031 people¦338031 astray¦338028 and said¦338032, “Peace¦338033,” when there's¦338034 no peace¦338035, \add it's as if\add* they're¦338039 building¦338037 a wall¦338038 and¦338039 then whitewashing¦338042 it¦338041.’\x + \xo 13:10: \xt Jer 6:14; 8:11.\x*
\v 11 Tell the ones who¦338047 are¦338047 whitewashing¦338048 the¦338060 wall¦338060 that¦338047 it'll¦338049 fall down. There'll be¦338047 a downpour, then I'll send hailstones to make it fall down, and¦338058 a strong wind to break¦338060 it down.
\v 12 See¦338062, the¦338064 wall¦338064 will¦338066 fall¦338063 down. Haven't others \add ≈asked¦338066\add* you where¦338068 the¦338069 white¦338069 coating \add went\add* that¦338070 you put on it¦338063?
\p
\v 13 Therefore my¦338077 master¦338077 Yahweh¦338077 says¦338076 this: ‘In my rage, I'll¦338079 bring a storm, and¦338084 in¦338083 my¦338083 anger¦338086, there'll be \add ≈heavy rain¦338084 causing floods\add*. In my rage, hailstones will¦338079 completely¦338091 destroy¦338091 \add @Yerushalem¦338077\add*.
\v 14 I'll tear¦338093 down¦338093 the¦338096 wall¦338096 that¦338097 you covered with¦338109 whitewash¦338100, and¦338101 I'll demolish it¦338101 to¦338102 ground¦338104 level and expose its¦338109 foundations¦338106. So¦338093 it'll¦338105 fall¦338107, and you'll be¦338105 annihilated in¦338109 the¦338109 middle¦338109 of¦338106 it all. Then¦338093 you \add people\add* will¦338110 know¦338110 that I¦338101 am¦338114 Yahweh¦338114.
\p
\v 15 In my¦338119 rage¦338119 I'll annihilate the wall and¦338116 those¦338129 who whitewashed it. I'll tell¦338124 you, “The¦338127 wall¦338127 doesn't exist anymore, nor do the people who¦338129 whitewashed it¦338130—
\v 16 those Israeli¦338132 prophets¦338132 who¦338134 prophesied¦338134 about¦338136 Yerushalem¦338138 and¦338139 had visions¦338141 of¦338132 peace for¦338140 it¦338140. But¦338139 there¦338143 isn't¦338143 any peace! That's¦338133 the¦338145 master¦338146 Yahweh's¦338147 declaration¦338145.” ’
