\v 17 \add ≈So¦338151\add*, son¦338151 of¦338151 humanity¦338153, \add ≈turn your¦338155 attention to\add* your¦338159 people's¦338159 daughters¦338158 and¦338162 prophesy¦338162 against¦338156 them¦338163 \add ≈because they invented prophecies¦338160 in their¦338161 own¦338161 imaginations¦338161\add*.
\v 18 Tell¦338165 \add >them¦338165\add* that the¦338179 master¦338170 Yahweh¦338170 says¦338168 this: ‘The¦338182 women¦338173 \add ≈won't end well\add* who¦338173 sew¦338173 magic charms onto every¦338177 part of their hands¦338180, and¦338181 make¦338181 headbands for people of \add ≈every walk of life¦338196\add* \add that are used to deceive people and\add* hunt¦338189 them down. \add Do you people really think you can get away with\add* hunting¦338192 down my¦338193 people, but¦338165 then¦338165 save¦338196 your own lives¦338196?
\v 19 You've profaned¦338198 me¦338200 among my people for¦338204 handfuls¦338204 of¦338204 barley¦338205 and¦338206 crumbs of¦338206 bread¦338207. \add ≡You¦338220 people have\add* killed¦338208 people who¦338210 shouldn't have died¦338213, and¦338214 saved the lives¦338219 of those who shouldn't have continued to live¦338219, because of your lies to my people who heard you¦338220.
\p
\v 20 Therefore¦338240 my¦338231 master¦338231 Yahweh¦338231 says¦338229 this: ‘I'm¦338233 against¦338234 the magic¦338236 charms that¦338237 you've used to \add ≈lure\add* the¦338243 people in as if they were birds¦338244. Indeed, I'll tear¦338245 them¦338246 from¦338247 your arms¦338248, and¦338249 I'll let the people you've trapped like birds go free¦338249.
\v 21 I'll¦338261 tear¦338261 away¦338261 your headbands and¦338261 rescue¦338265 my¦338268 people¦338268 from¦338269 your \add ≈control\add* so they'll¦338272 no longer be¦338280 trapped in¦338274 your \add ≈system\add*. Then¦338261 you \add people\add* will¦338272 know¦338276 that¦338277 I¦338265 am¦338280 Yahweh¦338280.
\p
\v 22 Because¦338282 you've discouraged¦338283 the righteous¦338286 people with lies¦338287 (even though I¦338288 didn't¦338289 desire their discouragement), and¦338288 because¦338282 you \add people\add* \add ≈encouraged¦338291 the¦338292 actions\add* of¦338292 the¦338293 wicked¦338293 people instead so they won't¦338289 change¦338296 their ways¦338297 to¦338294 save¦338299 their lives¦338299,
\v 23 \add ≈because¦338301 of that\add*, you'll no longer have false visions¦338305 or continue to make predictions, because I'll¦338310 rescue¦338310 my¦338313 people¦338313 out of your¦338314 \add ≈control\add*. Then you'll know¦338315 that¦338316 I¦338318 am¦338319 Yahweh¦338319.’ ”
\c 14
\s1 Yahweh's hate for idols
\rem /s1 Idolaters Condemned; God's Judgments Justified; God Condemns Idolatry; The Idolatry of Israel's Leaders
\p
\v 1 \add ≈One day\add* \add some\add* of¦338325 the¦338324 Israeli¦338325 elders¦338324 came¦338321 and¦338326 sat down \add to talk\add*,
\v 2 and¦338330 Yahweh¦338333 \add ≈gave\add* me¦338334 this message¦338331:
