\v 11 Because of¦338525 that¦338520, the¦338525 Israeli¦338525 people will¦338531 no longer wander¦338523 away from¦338528 following¦338528 me¦338528, nor defile¦338531 themselves¦338531 any longer through all¦338533 their¦338535 \add ≈disobedience\add*. They'll be¦338536 my¦338544 people, and¦338539 I'll¦338540 be their god¦338542. That's¦338520 the¦338543 master¦338544 Yahweh's¦338545 declaration¦338543.’ ”
