\v 3 Do¦338835 people¦338835 take¦338835 wood¦338830 from¦338836 \add @a vine\add* to make anything¦338832? Would anyone \add ≈use\add* \add @vine¦338836 wood¦338836\add* \add even\add* to make something to hang¦338838 a mug on¦338839?
