\c 20
\s1 Israeli rebellion
\rem /s1 The Rebellion of Israel; Rebellious Israel; The Lord's Will and Human Defiance; Israel's Continuing Rebellion
\p
\v 1 \add ≈Seven¦341189 years¦341188\add* \add after we'd been taken to Babylon\add*, \add ≈some\add* Israeli¦341195 elders¦341195 came¦341193 to¦341197 \add ≈get me¦341202 to ask Yahweh¦341200 for advice for them\add*.
