\p
\v 30 Therefore tell¦341756 the¦341760 \add ≈Israeli¦341760 people\add* that the master¦341764 Yahweh¦341764 \add ≈asks¦341763\add* this: ‘Why do you \add ≈defile¦341769 yourselves¦341769\add* with¦341766 your ancestors¦341767' customs? Why do you act¦341773 like¦341773 prostitutes¦341773, searching for¦341755 disgusting things¦341771?
\v 31 To¦341782 this day¦341787, when¦341775 you offer up¦341775 your gifts¦341776 (\add offering\add* your sons¦341778 \add ≈as burnt¦341779 sacrifices\add*), you defile¦341781 yourselves¦341781 with¦341775 all¦341782 your idols¦341784. So¦341775 why should¦341789 I let¦341789 you \add ≈try to¦341790 find me¦341795, you Israeli¦341791 people\add*? As I live¦341793, I won't allow you \add people\add* to \add ≈request my¦341795 help or advice\add*. That's the¦341796 master¦341797 Yahweh's¦341798 declaration¦341796.
\v 32 The¦341804 thought¦341814 that's¦341811 forming in your¦341807 mind will¦341810 never happen¦341810. You \add people\add* say¦341814, “Let's be¦341815 like¦341816 the other nations¦341816—like¦341817 the¦341817 clans¦341817 in other \add ≈countries¦341818\add* who worship¦341819 wood¦341820 and¦341821 stone¦341821.”
