\p
\v 33 This is the¦341823 master¦341827 Yahweh's¦341828 declaration¦341826: As I live¦341823, I'll¦341838 certainly reign¦341838 over¦341839 you \add people\add* with \add ≈strict control\add*, and¦341834 with¦341836 fury¦341836 that'll be poured¦341837 out¦341837 on¦341832 you.
\v 34 I'll bring¦341841 you out¦341841 from¦341843 the¦341845 other \add ≈people¦341845 groups\add* and¦341841 will¦341846 gather¦341846 you out of the¦341850 countries¦341850 where you've been¦341852 scattered¦341852. I'll do this with¦341853 \add ≈power, pouring¦341859 out fury¦341858\add*.
\v 35 Then¦341861 I'll bring¦341861 you into¦341863 the¦341865 wilderness¦341865 of¦341865 the¦341866 \add ≈people¦341866 groups\add*, and¦341861 there¦341869 I'll judge¦341867 you face¦341870 to¦341871 face¦341873—
\v 36 just¦341875 like¦341875 I¦341876 judged¦341876 your¦341879 ancestors¦341879 in¦341880 the Egyptian¦341882 wilderness¦341880, that's how I'll¦341884 judge¦341884 you¦341885 \add people\add*. That's the¦341886 master¦341887 Yahweh's¦341888 declaration¦341886.
\p
\v 37 I'll cause you \add people\add* to pass¦341890 under¦341892 my staff¦341893 \add to be counted\add*, and¦341894 I'll make¦341890 you obey the¦341893 requirements of¦341896 \add &our¦341897\add* agreement¦341897.
\v 38 I'll purge¦341899 the rebels¦341901 from among you, as well as those¦341901 who¦341901 revolt against¦341903 me¦341903. I'll send them¦341907 out¦341906 from the land¦341904 where¦341905 they're staying \add as foreigners\add*, but¦341899 they won't¦341912 enter Yisrael¦341911. Then¦341899 you \add people\add* will¦341906 know¦341914 that¦341915 I¦341906 am¦341918 Yahweh¦341918.
\p
\v 39 So¦341920 to you \add ≈Israeli¦341921 people\add*, the¦341942 master¦341928 Yahweh¦341928 says¦341926 this: ‘Each of¦341942 you should go¦341932 to his¦341931 own idols. Worship¦341933 them if¦341935 you refuse to listen¦341938 to¦341939 me¦341939, but¦341920 you must¦341938 no longer desecrate¦341945 my¦341928 sacred¦341943 name¦341942 with¦341948 your gifts¦341948 and¦341920 your idols,
\v 40 because¦341951 this is the master¦341960 Yahweh's¦341961 declaration¦341959: all¦341964 the \add ≈Israeli¦341957 people\add* will¦341963 worship¦341963 me there on¦341952 my¦341960 sacred¦341983 mountain¦341952 in¦341952 Yisrael¦341958. I'll¦341973 be happy to accept¦341971 your offerings¦341980 there, along with¦341952 your choice¦341979 gifts¦341980 \add ≈dedicated¦341983 to me\add*.
\v 41 I'll accept¦341987 you like a soothing¦341986 aroma¦341985 when¦341989 I¦341987 bring¦341989 you out¦341989 from¦341991 the¦341993 \add ≈people¦341993 groups\add* and¦341994 gather¦341994 you out of¦341985 the¦341998 countries¦341998 where you've been¦342000 scattered¦342000. I'll \add ≈display¦342002 my holiness¦342002\add* among¦342001 you for the nations¦342005 to¦342004 see.
\v 42 You'll know¦342007 that¦342008 I am¦342011 Yahweh¦342011 when¦342012 I bring¦342012 you¦342013 \add back\add* to¦342014 Yisrael¦342017—to the¦342016 land¦342016 that¦342021 I promised to¦342026 give¦342026 to¦342028 your¦342028 ancestors¦342028.
\v 43 There¦342032 you'll \add ≈call to mind\add* your conduct and¦342036 \add ≈everything you¦342041 defiled¦342041 yourselves¦342041 by¦342042 doing¦342049\add*, and you'll despise yourselves for all¦342045 the evil¦342047 things you've¦342041 done¦342049.
\v 44 Then¦342051 you'll know¦342051 that¦342052 I am¦342055 Yahweh¦342069, when¦342056 I do¦342056 this to¦342061 you for¦342058 the¦342058 sake¦342058 of my¦342059 \add ≈reputation¦342059\add*, not¦342060 because of¦342061 your evil¦342062 practices¦342063, and¦342063 not because of¦342063 your corrupt¦342064 actions, \add ≈you Israeli¦342065 people\add*. That's¦342052 the master¦342068 Yahweh's¦342055 declaration¦342067.’ ”
\s1 The burnt forest
