\v 14 I, Yahweh¦344228, have¦344212 declared¦344226 it, and I will do¦344214 it. I won't¦344215 relent, nor will I rest from it. \add ≈You'll be¦344213 judged¦344225 by your own practices¦344223 and your¦344223 own behaviour¦344223\add*. That's the¦344226 master¦344227 Yahweh's¦344211 declaration¦344226.”
