\v 1 \add ≈At the¦344774 beginning\add* of¦344774 the month¦344772 in¦344767 the eleventh year¦344770 \add since King Yoyakin (Jehoiachin) had been taken captive\add*, Yahweh¦344776 \add ≈gave me¦344777\add* a message¦344774:\x + \xo 26:1–28:19: \xt Yoel 3:4-8; Amos 1:9-10.\x*
\v 2 “Son¦344780 of¦344780 humanity¦344782, Tsor¦344787 \add !(Tyre¦344787)\add* has¦344795 said¦344786 against Yerushalem, ‘\add ≈Nice¦344790 one\add*! \add ≈Yerushalem's¦344790\add* gates are¦344792 broken¦344792. \add ≈It's¦344798 going my way—I¦344797 can take advantage\add* because¦344783 it's¦344792 been¦344798 destroyed¦344792.’
