\v 8 He'll kill¦344884 your daughters¦344881 in¦344883 the¦344882 countryside¦344882. He'll set up a siege¦344887 program and¦344888 build¦344888 a ramp against your walls and¦344891 lift¦344891 up¦344891 shields¦344893 against you¦344892.
\v 9 He'll¦344897 use his battering¦344896 rams to \add ≈smash¦344900 down\add* your walls¦344898, and¦344895 he'll¦344897 tear¦344900 down your towers¦344899 with¦344898 his axes¦344901.
