\v 20 then¦345083 I'll take you¦345083 down to the¦345087 pit¦345087 that ancient people¦345090 went down to¦345092, because I'll make¦345092 you live¦345107 in the lowest¦345094 realms of the earth like¦345095 ancient ruins¦345095. Because of¦345099 that¦345101, you won't¦345102 come back and¦345083 \add ≈be splendid¦345105\add* in¦345106 the land¦345106 of the¦345107 living¦345107.
\v 21 I'll¦345110 send disaster onto you¦345110, and¦345111 you won't¦345113 exist anymore. Then \add people\add* will¦345111 look for you, but¦345111 you'll¦345111 never be¦345112 found¦345115 again¦345116. That's the¦345118 master¦345119 Yahweh's¦345120 declaration¦345118.”\x + \xo 26:21: \xt Rev 18:21.\x*
