\p
\v 1 Then Yahweh¦345605 \add ≈gave\add* me¦345606 \add another\add* message¦345603:
\v 2 “Son¦345609 of¦345609 humanity¦345611, tell Tsor's¦345614 ruler¦345613 that the master¦345619 Yahweh¦345619 says¦345617 this: Your¦345623 heart¦345623 is proud¦345622 and¦345624 you've said¦345624, “I'm a god¦345625. I'll sit¦345629 in the seat¦345627 of¦345627 gods¦345628 in¦345630 the¦345630 \add ≈vital centre\add* of¦345630 the¦345631 oceans¦345631.” Even though you're a man¦345611 and not¦345634 a god¦345636, you \add ≈tell yourself that you're\add* a god¦345640.
\p
\v 3 Listen, \add you king of Tsor\add*, are¦345643 you wiser¦345643 than¦345645 Daniyel was? Are¦345643 there¦345642 any secrets¦345650 that¦345650 you don't¦345651 \add already\add* know?
\v 4 You've used your wisdom¦345654 and¦345655 skill to make yourself¦345657 wealthy¦345658, and¦345659 amassed¦345659 gold¦345660 and¦345661 silver¦345661 in¦345655 your¦345655 treasuries¦345662.
\v 5 By¦345664 great¦345664 wisdom¦345665 and¦345669 by¦345666 your trading¦345666, you've multiplied¦345667 your wealth, \add ≈but¦345669\add* \add now\add* \add ≈you've become¦345669\add* arrogant¦345669 because of¦345671 your¦345671 wealth.
