\v 15 It'll be¦346298 the least significant kingdom¦346297, and¦346300 it¦346302 won't¦346300 \add ≈become prominent\add* again¦346303 among the¦346306 nations¦346306. I'll¦346307 diminish them¦346307 so that they'll no longer \add ≈dominate\add* \add other\add* nations¦346310.
