\v 6 Yahweh¦346526 says¦346510 this: The¦346516 ones who¦346513 support¦346513 Egypt \add militarily\add* will fall¦346512, and¦346515 the pride¦346516 of¦346516 \add @Egypt's¦346514\add* strength¦346517 will \add ≈collapse\add*. From¦346518 Migdol¦346518 to Seveneh¦346519 \add @their¦346510 combined¦346510 warriors¦346510\add* will be killed by¦346520 the sword¦346520. That's the¦346524 master¦346525 Yahweh's¦346511 declaration¦346524.
