\v 16 Then¦346676 I'll¦346676 set¦346676 fire¦346677 to¦346685 Egypt¦346678: Pelusium¦346682 will be in¦346678 great agony¦346679, Thebes¦346683 will be¦346685 broken¦346685 up, and¦346676 Memphis¦346686 will face enemies¦346687 every day¦346688.
\v 17 The¦346690 young¦346690 men¦346690 of¦346690 Aven and¦346692 Pi-Veset \add cities\add* will be killed by¦346695 the sword¦346695, and their \add ≈populations will be taken\add* into¦346698 captivity¦346698.
