\v 21 “Son¦346747 of¦346747 humanity¦346749, I've¦346757 broken¦346757 the¦346752 Egyptian¦346756 king¦346754 Far-oh's arm¦346752. Listen, it¦346761 hasn't been¦346761 \add ≈put¦346764 in¦346769 a splint\add*, or set¦346764 to heal with¦346769 a bandage¦346765, so that it'll become strong¦346767 enough \add again\add* to¦346768 hold a sword¦346769.
