\v 25 They¦347699 \add ≈prepared\add* a bed¦347681 for¦347682 Eylam and¦347699 all its multitudes¦347685 among those who were slain—its¦347685 graves¦347687 surround¦347686 it¦347686. All¦347688 of them¦347688 are¦347689 uncircumcised¦347689, pierced by the sword¦347692, because¦347693 they brought their terrors¦347696 onto the land¦347697 of the¦347698 living¦347698. So they carry their own shame¦347700, together with¦347701 the ones going down into the pit among all those who've been killed, those who¦347703 are going¦347703 down¦347703 into the¦347704 pit¦347704. \add @Eylam\add* is among all those who were killed.
