\v 20 \add ≈Yes¦348235,\add* you people say¦348225, “The¦348228 master's¦348229 way¦348228 isn't¦348226 fair!” \add but\add* I'll¦348232 judge¦348232 each of¦348228 you \add ≈Israeli¦348234 people\add* according¦348231 to¦348231 \add ≈your behaviour¦348228\add*.”
