\v 21 In¦348239 \add ≈mid-January\add* of¦348239 the twelfth year¦348241 of our¦348245 captivity \add in Babylon\add*, \add ≈someone who'd escaped¦348249\add* from¦348250 Yerushalem¦348250 \add !(Jerusalem¦348250)\add* came¦348246 to¦348248 me and¦348238 told¦348251 me that the¦348253 city¦348253 had¦348252 been¦348252 captured.\x + \xo 33:21: \xt 2Ki 25:3-10; Jer 39:2-8; 52:4-14.\x*
