\p
\v 25 Therefore tell¦348315 them¦348316 that the¦348325 master¦348321 Yahweh¦348321 says¦348319 this: You eat¦348327 blood, and¦348328 you \add ≈pay your respect to¦348330\add* your idols¦348332, then you pour out people's blood¦348333. Should you then inherit¦348336 that land¦348335?
