\p
\v 1 Then Yahweh¦349070 \add ≈gave\add* me¦349071 \add another\add* message¦349068:\x + \xo 35:1-15: \xt Isa 34:5-17; 63:1-6; Jer 49:7-22; Eze 25:12-14; Amos 1:11-12; Oba 1-14; Mal 1:2-5.\x*
\v 2 “Son¦349074 of¦349074 humanity¦349076, \add ≈look out towards\add* Mt¦349081. Seir¦349082 and¦349083 prophesy¦349083 against it¦349084.
\v 3 Tell¦349086 it¦349087 that the master¦349090 Yahweh¦349090 says¦349089 this: Listen, I'm¦349092 against¦349093 you¦349093 \add Edom, represented by\add* Mt¦349094. Seir¦349096, and¦349097 I'll¦349097 \add ≈work against you¦349099 to\add* make¦349100 you¦349100 a desolation¦349101 and¦349102 a waste¦349102.
\v 4 I'll¦349106 \add ≈turn\add* your¦349104 cities¦349104 into ruins¦349105, and¦349107 you¦349109 yourself will¦349109 become desolate¦349108. Then you'll¦349109 know¦349110 that¦349111 I¦349113 am¦349114 Yahweh¦349114.
\p
\v 5 You've¦349126 always been hostile to the Israeli¦349124 people¦349124, and¦349121 when they were distressed you¦349121 \add ≈decided to attack them with¦349132 swords¦349131\add*—at¦349132 the¦349132 time¦349132 their¦349133 punishment¦349135 was coming to an end¦349136.
\v 6 Therefore, this is the¦349139 master¦349143 Yahweh's¦349144 declaration¦349142: As I live¦349139, I'll¦349148 prepare¦349148 you for¦349145 bloodshed¦349147, and¦349149 bloodshed¦349149 will¦349150 chase after you. Since you didn't¦349153 hate¦349155 bloodshed, bloodshed will \add ≈come to¦349147\add* you.
\v 7 I'll¦349159 make¦349159 \add ≈Edom\add* completely desolate¦349165 when I¦349166 cut¦349166 \add ≈it off¦349166 so that¦349168 no one¦349169 will¦349159 want to¦349164 pass¦349168 through¦349168 it\add*.
\v 8 I'll¦349171 fill¦349171 its¦349174 mountain¦349174 \add ranges\add* with¦349185 people who were killed—those¦349181 killed by the sword¦349183 will¦349171 fall¦349184 on¦349185 your high hills¦349176 and¦349177 valleys¦349177 and¦349178 in¦349185 all¦349178 your¦349180 streams.
\v 9 I'll¦349189 make¦349189 \add ≈your¦349190 land perpetually¦349188 desolate\add*. Your¦349190 cities¦349190 won't¦349191 be¦349198 inhabited, and¦349194 then you'll know¦349194 that¦349195 I¦349197 am¦349198 Yahweh¦349198.
